Vasiṣṭha leads the queens toward Rāma --- Queens find the brothers' lonely bathing ford --- Kausalyā mourns the iṅgudī offering to Daśaratha --- Mothers weep seeing Rāma bereft of luxuries --- Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa clasp their mothers' feet --- Kausalyā embraces and bewails forest-worn Sītā --- Rāma honors Vasiṣṭha while Bharata sits with counselors --- Onlookers await Bharata's plea as the brothers shine